{
  "name": "DueSoonDigest",
  "displayName": "期限が近いタスクを Teams に通知",
  "description": "平日 9 時 (日本時間) に SharePoint の未完了タスクを確認し、期限が WITHIN_DAYS 日以内のものだけ Teams にまとめて投稿する。該当がなければ投稿しない。",
  "state": "on",
  "definition": {
    "triggers": {
      "Recurrence": {
        "type": "Recurrence",
        "recurrence": {
          "frequency": "Week",
          "interval": 1,
          "timeZone": "Tokyo Standard Time",
          "schedule": {
            "hours": [
              "9"
            ],
            "minutes": [
              0
            ],
            "weekDays": [
              "Monday",
              "Tuesday",
              "Wednesday",
              "Thursday",
              "Friday"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "actions": {
      "Get_items": {
        "type": "OpenApiConnection",
        "inputs": {
          "host": {
            "connectionName": "shared_sharepointonline",
            "operationId": "GetItems"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "dataset": "{{SP_SITE_URL}}",
            "table": "{{SP_LIST}}",
            "$top": 200
          }
        }
      },
      "Due_soon": {
        "runAfter": {
          "Get_items": [
            "Succeeded"
          ]
        },
        "type": "Query",
        "inputs": {
          "from": "@coalesce(outputs('Get_items')?['body/value'], json('[]'))",
          "where": "@and(not(or(equals(string(coalesce(item()?['Status'], '')), '完了'), contains(string(coalesce(item()?['Status'], '')), '\"Value\":\"完了\"'), contains(string(coalesce(item()?['Status'], '')), '\"Value\": \"完了\"'))), if(empty(item()?['DueDate']), false, lessOrEquals(convertFromUtc(item()?['DueDate'], 'Tokyo Standard Time', 'yyyy-MM-dd'), convertFromUtc(addDays(utcNow(), {{WITHIN_DAYS}}), 'Tokyo Standard Time', 'yyyy-MM-dd'))))"
        }
      },
      "Has_any": {
        "runAfter": {
          "Due_soon": [
            "Succeeded"
          ]
        },
        "type": "If",
        "expression": {
          "and": [
            {
              "greater": [
                "@length(body('Due_soon'))",
                0
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "actions": {
          "Format_lines": {
            "type": "Select",
            "inputs": {
              "from": "@body('Due_soon')",
              "select": "@concat('・ ', coalesce(item()?['Title'], '(無題)'), ' — ', convertFromUtc(item()?['DueDate'], 'Tokyo Standard Time', 'yyyy/MM/dd'))"
            }
          },
          "Join_lines": {
            "runAfter": {
              "Format_lines": [
                "Succeeded"
              ]
            },
            "type": "Join",
            "inputs": {
              "from": "@body('Format_lines')",
              "joinWith": "<br>"
            }
          },
          "Post_message": {
            "runAfter": {
              "Join_lines": [
                "Succeeded"
              ]
            },
            "type": "OpenApiConnection",
            "inputs": {
              "host": {
                "connectionName": "shared_teams",
                "operationId": "PostMessageToConversation"
              },
              "parameters": {
                "poster": "Flow bot",
                "location": "Channel",
                "body/recipient/groupId": "{{TEAMS_GROUP_ID}}",
                "body/recipient/channelId": "{{TEAMS_CHANNEL_ID}}",
                "body/messageBody": "<p><b>@{convertFromUtc(utcNow(), 'Tokyo Standard Time', 'yyyy/MM/dd')} の期限チェック</b>（@{length(body('Due_soon'))} 件 / {{WITHIN_DAYS}} 日以内。超過も含む）</p><p>@{body('Join_lines')}</p>"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "postImport": [
    "リストに列 Title、DueDate (日付)、Status があること。Status は 1 行テキストの「完了」、または選択肢の値が「完了」",
    "「複数の項目の取得」は先頭 200 件まで。古い項目が上限を埋めると新しい期限を取りこぼすので、リストが大きくなったらデザイナーでフィルタークエリを足す",
    "トリガーと「メッセージを投稿する」を開き、サイト / リスト / チーム / チャネルが正しく出ているか確認する (出なければ選び直す)",
    "テストするときは期限が今日から 3 日以内の未完了行を 1 件入れて、フローを手動実行する。0 件のときは投稿されない"
  ]
}
